'Government Agent' includes an Additional Government Agent, Assistant  Government  Agent,  Additional  Assistant  Government  Agent, Assistant  Commissioner-General  of  Lands,  District  Land  Officer  and any officer authorized by the Government Agent in writing in respect of any particular matter or provision of this Ordinance;

